    "description": "<p>Varsity jackets—often called <span data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"373\">letterman jackets</span>—are iconic outerwear pieces rooted in American sports and school culture. Traditionally designed with a warm wool body and durable leather sleeves, these jackets feature bold chenille letters or patches that represent a school, sport, or achievement. First popularized in the early 1900s, varsity jackets were originally worn by athletes to showcase their accomplishments. Today, they’ve evolved into a global fashion staple worn by students, teams, and style enthusiasts alike.</p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wraper woocommerce tinv-wishlist tinvwl-shortcode-add-to-cart tinvwl-loop-button-wrapper tinvwl-woocommerce_product_get_description\" data-tinvwl_product_id=\"4007\">\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"></div>\n<p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" name=\"add-to-wishlist\" aria-label=\"Add to Wishlist\" class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist_button tinvwl-icon-heart  tinvwl-position-after tinvwl-loop\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"4007\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-productvariations=\"[0]\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"variable\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\"><span class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist-text\">Add to Wishlist</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"></div>\n<div class=\"tinvwl-tooltip\">Add to Wishlist</div>\n</div>",
